# Public repository: source, tests and sanitized documentation only.
# Deny unknown file types by default, then allow source/documentation formats.
*
!*/
!*.js
!*.cjs
!*.mjs
!*.css
!*.html
!*.py
!*.bat
!*.ps1
!*.md
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/LICENSE
!/NOTICE
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json

